{"id":423,"name":"gastrodon","speciesId":423,"dex":423,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["water","ground"],"stats":{"hp":111,"attack":83,"defense":68,"special-attack":92,"special-defense":82,"speed":39},"abilities":[{"name":"sticky-hold","hidden":false},{"name":"storm-drain","hidden":false},{"name":"sand-force","hidden":true}],"height":9,"weight":299,"baseExp":166,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/423.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/423.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/423.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/423.ogg","genus":"Sea Slug Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It has a pliable body without any bones. If any part of its body is torn off, it grows right back."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It apparently had a huge shell for protection in ancient times. It lives in shallow tidal pools."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes."},{"version":"sun","text":"It has strong regenerative capabilities. Even if parts of it are bitten off by fish Pokémon, it will return to normal within a few hours."},{"version":"moon","text":"Plankton, invisible to the naked eye, is its main food source. It comes onto the land periodically, but the reason for this is not known."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Long ago, it had a shell on its back. There’s now a vestigial plate on its back that’s hard but thin."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Their shape and color change, depending on their environment and diet. There are many of them at beaches where the waves are calm."},{"version":"sword","text":"Its search for 